sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 客户端
    participant Nginx as Nginx/ALB负载均衡
    participant Gateway as ApiGatewayFilter
    participant Sentinel as Sentinel限流熔断
    participant Auth as Spring Security认证
    participant Router as RouterFunction路由
    participant Handler as UserHandler
    participant Service as UserService
    
    Note over Client,Service: API网关请求处理完整流程
    
    Client->>Nginx: HTTPS请求<br/>POST /api/v1/users
    activate Nginx
    Note right of Nginx: SSL终止<br/>负载均衡
    
    Nginx->>Gateway: 转发到应用<br/>X-Real-IP: 客户端IP
    activate Gateway
    Note right of Gateway: Order: HIGHEST_PRECEDENCE+20<br/>最前端过滤器
    
    Gateway->>Gateway: 生成/透传 X-Request-Id
    Note right of Gateway: traceId写入MDC<br/>全链路日志关联
    
    Gateway->>Gateway: 记录请求开始时间
    
    Gateway->>Sentinel: 限流检查
    activate Sentinel
    
    alt 限流规则命中
        Sentinel--xGateway: FlowException
        Gateway--xNginx: 429 Too Many Requests
        Nginx--xClient: 429 + 限流提示
    else 通过限流检查
        Sentinel-->>Gateway: 通过
        deactivate Sentinel
        
        Gateway->>Auth: 认证检查
        activate Auth
        
        alt JWT Token无效
            Auth--xGateway: UnauthorizedException
            Gateway--xNginx: 401 Unauthorized
            Nginx--xClient: 401 + 认证失败
        else JWT Token有效
            Auth-->>Gateway: 用户信息SecurityContext
            deactivate Auth
            
            Gateway->>Router: 路由匹配
            activate Router
            Note right of Router: 函数式路由<br/>POST → UserHandler
            
            Router->>Handler: createUser(request)
            activate Handler
            
            Handler->>Handler: 参数校验<br/>@Valid
            Handler->>Handler: 权限检查<br/>@RequirePermission
            
            Handler->>Service: createUser(dto)
            activate Service
            Note right of Service: 业务逻辑执行
            
            Service-->>Handler: Mono<UserDTO>
            deactivate Service
            
            Handler-->>Router: ServerResponse 201 Created
            deactivate Handler
            
            Router-->>Gateway: 响应结果
            deactivate Router
            
            Gateway->>Gateway: 记录响应时间
            Note right of Gateway: 计算耗时<br/>P99: 50ms
            
            Gateway->>Gateway: 上报Prometheus指标
            Note right of Gateway: apex_gateway_request_count<br/>apex_gateway_response_time
            
            Gateway-->>Nginx: 201 + UserDTO
            deactivate Gateway
            
            Nginx-->>Client: 201 Created + 用户数据
            deactivate Nginx
        end
    end
    
    Note over Client,Service: 监控指标
    Note over Gateway: 请求计数、错误计数、响应时间P50/P95/P99
    Note over Sentinel: 限流触发次数、拒绝率
    Note over Auth: 认证成功率、Token过期率
